{"nodes":[{"id":"light_title","type":"text","text":"🌞 光明侧（zn占主导）","x":200,"y":170,"width":200,"height":50,"color":"3"},{"id":"light_1","type":"text","text":"🐉 龙与魔法 zn+ALL\n全十元调度 史诗级世界观\n→ 黑龙/邪龙（x侵蚀zn）\n[[奇幻_龙与魔法.canvas]]","x":100,"y":250,"width":260,"height":120,"color":"6"},{"id":"light_2","type":"text","text":"🧝 精灵/森林 zn+n\n永生的栖息地 神性有形状\n→ 堕精灵（zn被nx替代）\n[[奇幻_精灵森林.canvas]]","x":380,"y":250,"width":260,"height":120,"color":"6"},{"id":"light_3","type":"text","text":"🌳 自然之灵 zn+nz\n森林本身的意志\n→ 腐化森林（nz被x污染）\n[[奇幻_自然之灵.canvas]]","x":660,"y":250,"width":260,"height":120,"color":"6"},{"id":"light_4","type":"text","text":"🕊️ 天使/神域 zn+zx\n神圣秩序 光即法则\n→ 堕天使领域（zn被xn取代）\n[[奇幻_天使神域.canvas]]","x":100,"y":380,"width":260,"height":120,"color":"6"},{"id":"light_5","type":"text","text":"🌅 远古/创世 zn+xz\n意义未被定义时\n→ 意义被遗忘之后\n[[奇幻_远古创世.canvas]]","x":380,"y":380,"width":260,"height":120,"color":"6"},{"id":"light_6","type":"text","text":"🏛️ 乌托邦/仙境 zn+x并z\n表面完美——但那是壳\n→ 黑暗面天然内置\n[[奇幻_乌托邦仙境.canvas]]","x":660,"y":380,"width":260,"height":120,"color":"6"},{"id":"mid_title","type":"text","text":"⚖️ 中性侧（zn与xz平衡）","x":200,"y":530,"width":200,"height":50,"color":"4"},{"id":"mid_1","type":"text","text":"🗿 矮人/地底 xn+zx\n矿物锻冶文明\n→ 矮人废墟（xn→nx）\n[[奇幻_矮人地底.canvas]]","x":100,"y":610,"width":230,"height":110,"color":"6"},{"id":"mid_2","type":"text","text":"🔮 秘术/学院 xn+zn\n知识即力量\n→ 知识即诅咒/知识即谎言\n[[奇幻_秘术学院.canvas]]","x":350,"y":610,"width":230,"height":110,"color":"6"},{"id":"mid_3","type":"text","text":"⚓ 海盗/航海 xz+zx\n游离于秩序之外\n→ 诅咒之海（zx→x）\n[[奇幻_海盗航海.canvas]]","x":600,"y":610,"width":230,"height":110,"color":"6"},{"id":"mid_4","type":"text","text":"⏳ 时间遗迹 xz+nz\n被遗忘的文明\n→ 时间诅咒（nz→x）\n[[奇幻_时间遗迹.canvas]]","x":850,"y":610,"width":230,"height":110,"color":"6"},{"id":"mid_5","type":"text","text":"🛡️ 骑士王国 zx+xn\n封建秩序的荣耀\n→ 堕落骑士团（zx→nx）\n[[奇幻_骑士王国.canvas]]","x":100,"y":730,"width":230,"height":110,"color":"6"},{"id":"mid_6","type":"text","text":"🎪 游牧/流浪 xz+n\n容器是流动的\n→ 被诅咒的流浪（n被xz吞）\n[[奇幻_游牧流浪.canvas]]","x":350,"y":730,"width":230,"height":110,"color":"6"},{"id":"mid_7","type":"text","text":"⛰️ 巨人/山脉 n+xz\n巨大沉默的承载\n→ 被腐蚀的山脉（n→x）\n[[奇幻_巨人山脉.canvas]]","x":600,"y":730,"width":230,"height":110,"color":"6"},{"id":"dark_title","type":"text","text":"🌑 黑暗侧（x/xz占主导）","x":200,"y":870,"width":200,"height":50,"color":"2"},{"id":"dark_1","type":"text","text":"💀 亡灵/诅咒 nx+x\n死亡的暗账与未完的欲望\n← 精灵的堕落面\n[[奇幻_亡灵诅咒.canvas]]","x":100,"y":950,"width":250,"height":110,"color":"2"},{"id":"dark_2","type":"text","text":"🌊 深渊/混沌 xz+x\n边缘被吞噬 意义消失\n← 龙与魔法的阴影面\n[[奇幻_深渊混沌.canvas]]","x":370,"y":950,"width":250,"height":110,"color":"2"},{"id":"dark_3","type":"text","text":"⛪ 哥特奇幻 zn+xz\n神圣的废墟——意义走了骨架在\n← 天使神域的废墟\n[[奇幻_哥特奇幻.canvas]]","x":640,"y":950,"width":250,"height":110,"color":"2"},{"id":"dark_4","type":"text","text":"🩸 血源诅咒 x+nx\n欲望永远在结算\n← 骑士王国的堕落\n[[奇幻_血源诅咒.canvas]]","x":100,"y":1070,"width":250,"height":110,"color":"2"},{"id":"dark_5","type":"text","text":"🖤 魂系 xz+n\n孤独的重压中找出口\n← 巨人山脉被腐蚀\n[[奇幻_魂系.canvas]]","x":370,"y":1070,"width":250,"height":110,"color":"2"},{"id":"dark_6","type":"text","text":"👁️ 洛夫克拉夫特 xz+x+zn\n不可知的恐惧——知道太多会疯\n← 秘术的黑暗面\n[[奇幻_洛夫克拉夫特.canvas]]","x":640,"y":1070,"width":250,"height":110,"color":"2"},{"id":"dark_7","type":"text","text":"🔥 末世废土 xn+x\n规则已崩塌只剩欲望\n← 乌托邦的背面\n[[奇幻_末世废土.canvas]]","x":910,"y":950,"width":250,"height":110,"color":"2"},{"id":"more_1","type":"text","text":"🧜 人鱼/深海 xz+nz  🏜️ 沙漠/荒原 xz+n\n🌋 火山/熔岩 x+z  🧊 冰原/北境 nz+xz\n🌙 月下/梦境 nz+zn  🦋 妖精/幻象 x并z+zn\n⚙️ 机械/魔法朋克 xn+zx（已补充案例→右侧）  🧬 血肉/生物朋克 x+xz\n🧠 心像/精神空间 n+zn  🎭 假面/伪装世界 x并z+n","x":100,"y":1280,"width":1000,"height":140,"color":"6"},{"id":"seal_info","type":"text","text":"📌 共约30个子类型，每张子画布展开为：十元拆解→典型作品→设计原则→误判→封存句\n📎 子画布以 [[奇幻_子类型名.canvas]] 的形式在主画布中可点击跳转\n\n所有已完成的子画布：龙与魔法 · 精灵森林 · 自然之灵 · 天使神域 · 远古创世 · 乌托邦仙境","x":200,"y":1460,"width":800,"height":120,"color":"1"},{"id":"more_title","type":"text","text":"🔽 待展开子类型（约10个）","x":200,"y":1200,"width":250,"height":50,"color":"5"},{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"🧙 奇幻环境设计 · 完整子类型谱系\n\n核心公式：奇幻 = xz（边缘/不可能）+ zn（新意义体系）\n所有子类型都是 xz 与 zn 的不同配比，再加入第三个十元作为风味","x":300,"y":-40,"width":500,"height":100,"color":"1"},{"id":"env_index_note","type":"text","text":"🏞️ 环境子类型（已扩展→点击跳转）：\n🌿 [[环境_自然环境.canvas|自然环境]]\n🏘️ [[环境_废墟遗迹.canvas|废墟/遗迹]]\n🏙️ [[环境_城市聚落.canvas|城市/聚落]]\n🗺️ [[环境_幻想异界.canvas|幻想/异界]]\n🕯️ [[环境_秘境圣所.canvas|秘境/圣所]]","x":450,"y":1500,"width":350,"height":160,"color":"6"},{"id":"mechpunk_title","type":"text","text":"⚙️ 机械／魔法朋克 xn+zx\n规则被物化为齿轮——魔法的工业化","x":1280,"y":180,"width":440,"height":90,"color":"1"},{"id":"mechpunk_case","type":"text","text":"📌 补充案例：东方机械幻想\n鬼角武装少女 × 机械龙蛇外置兵装\n科幻奇幻混合｜和风机甲｜角色设定图","x":1280,"y":310,"width":440,"height":115,"color":"6"},{"id":"mechpunk_core","type":"text","text":"核心结构\nxn 8：模块、关节、能源、机械秩序\nzx 7：刀、尾刃、战斗平台、执行功能\nxz 6：鬼角、异形机械兽、不可能组合\nzn 4：和风身份、刀剑文化、红绳纹样","x":1280,"y":465,"width":440,"height":165,"color":"4"},{"id":"mechpunk_object","type":"text","text":"对象关系\n自然人形少女＋外置大型机械兵装\n机械同时是：坐骑＋伴生兽＋武器＋身份图腾\n重点不是驾驶，而是第二身体。","x":1760,"y":310,"width":430,"height":145,"color":"6"},{"id":"mechpunk_visual","type":"text","text":"视觉风格\n日系二次元游戏角色设定图\n赛璐璐人物平涂＋高密度硬表面机械\n低密度少女 × 高密度机械\n竖直静态人物 × 横向攻击轮廓","x":1760,"y":495,"width":430,"height":160,"color":"4"},{"id":"mechpunk_palette","type":"text","text":"色彩与造型\n黑灰白无彩底｜红色主强调｜青色能源点缀\n尖角、三角、后掠翼、刀刃、分节尾\n锐利／速度／猎食者型机械语言","x":1280,"y":680,"width":440,"height":145,"color":"3"},{"id":"mechpunk_theme","type":"text","text":"概念表达\n柔软身体 × 坚硬机器\n古代刀剑 × 未来机械\n优雅 × 危险\n脆弱本体拥有超出身体尺度的力量。","x":1760,"y":700,"width":430,"height":145,"color":"2"},{"id":"mechpunk_check","type":"text","text":"⚠️ 误判校正\n不是标准赛博朋克：缺少高科技低生活、企业压迫、霓虹都市等社会语境。\n不是传统巨大机甲：更接近舰装式外置兵装与机械伴生体。","x":1280,"y":875,"width":440,"height":140,"color":"5"},{"id":"mechpunk_formula","type":"text","text":"封存公式\n机械／魔法朋克 = xn＋zx\n本案例：xn＋zx 为骨架，xz＋zn 提供东方异族风味。\n少女不是骑着机器，机器是她延伸出去的身体。","x":1760,"y":890,"width":430,"height":145,"color":"1"}],"edges":[{"id":"e1","fromNode":"title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"light_title","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"mid_title","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"dark_title","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"light_title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"light_1","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e5","fromNode":"light_title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"light_2","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e6","fromNode":"light_title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"light_3","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e7","fromNode":"light_title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"light_4","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e8","fromNode":"mid_title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"mid_1","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e9","fromNode":"mid_title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"mid_2","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e10","fromNode":"mid_title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"mid_3","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e11","fromNode":"mid_title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"mid_4","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e12","fromNode":"dark_title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"dark_1","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e13","fromNode":"dark_title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"dark_2","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e14","fromNode":"dark_title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"dark_3","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e15","fromNode":"mid_title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"mid_5","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e16","fromNode":"mid_title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"mid_6","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e17","fromNode":"mid_title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"mid_7","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e18","fromNode":"dark_title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"dark_4","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e19","fromNode":"dark_title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"dark_5","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e20","fromNode":"dark_title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"dark_6","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e21","fromNode":"dark_title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"dark_7","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e22","fromNode":"title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"more_title","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_fix_light_title_light_5","fromNode":"light_title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"light_5","toSide":"top","label":""},{"id":"e_fix_light_title_light_6","fromNode":"light_title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"light_6","toSide":"top","label":""},{"id":"e_fix_more_title_more_1","fromNode":"more_title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"more_1","toSide":"top","label":""},{"id":"e_fix_title_seal_info","fromNode":"title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"seal_info","toSide":"top","label":""},{"id":"e_fix_title_env_index_note","fromNode":"title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"env_index_note","toSide":"top","label":""},{"id":"e_more_to_mechpunk","fromNode":"more_1","fromSide":"right","toNode":"mechpunk_title","toSide":"left","label":"已补充"},{"id":"e_mech_title_case","fromNode":"mechpunk_title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"mechpunk_case","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_mech_case_core","fromNode":"mechpunk_case","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"mechpunk_core","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_mech_case_object","fromNode":"mechpunk_case","fromSide":"right","toNode":"mechpunk_object","toSide":"left"},{"id":"e_mech_core_palette","fromNode":"mechpunk_core","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"mechpunk_palette","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_mech_object_visual","fromNode":"mechpunk_object","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"mechpunk_visual","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_mech_palette_check","fromNode":"mechpunk_palette","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"mechpunk_check","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_mech_visual_theme","fromNode":"mechpunk_visual","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"mechpunk_theme","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_mech_check_formula","fromNode":"mechpunk_check","fromSide":"right","toNode":"mechpunk_formula","toSide":"left"},{"id":"e_mech_theme_formula","fromNode":"mechpunk_theme","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"mechpunk_formula","toSide":"top"}]}